      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Absolutely, your concerns are valid and there are ways to help. First, you can try using a high-quality air purifier with a HEPA filter in your home to capture any airborne particulates. Additionally, you can place plants like spider plants or peace lilies around your home, as they are known to absorb toxins from the air. Lastly, consider using essential oils like lavender or eucalyptus in a diffuser to help neutralize the chemical smell and promote a calming atmosphere. Remember, your well-being is important and there are always solutions to help you feel better.",
